Description: Tools for fitting distributed lag non-linear models within a Bayesian framework using Laplacian P-splines. The package enables flexible modelling of complex exposure-lag-response relationships based on the methodology of Rutten et al. (2026) <https://doi.org/10.1007/s11222-025-10790-9>.
